# Study app palette

For the study app / msc_cyber-syllabus, use ONLY this palette until Karina changes it:

- `#5003C0` purple (primary CTA, Start tutorial)
- `#AB03A9` magenta (active tabs, signal)
- `#FF467A` pink (highlights, wrong/miss feedback)
- `#FFD51E` yellow (warm accent, course tab bar)
- `#FFF9E6` light surface (soft backgrounds - light tint of yellow)

Flat solid colors, no gradients. Active tabs = magenta `#AB03A9`. Start tutorial / primary CTA = purple `#5003C0`.
